1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:01,280
Léa, réveille

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:03,160
toi mon amour.

3
00:00:03,160 --> 00:00:05,160
Je suis terrifié.

4
00:00:05,840 --> 00:00:06,360
Il y a un truc

5
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:06,760
chaud sur

6
00:00:06,760 --> 00:00:07,800
mes pieds.

7
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:08,760
Je regarde pas.

8
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:09,440
Je te jure

9
00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:11,280
que je regarde pas.

10
00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:11,920
C'est doux

11
00:00:11,920 --> 00:00:12,800
et humide.

12
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:13,560
Ça tient comme

13
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:13,880
une main.

14
00:00:13,880 --> 00:00:15,400
Mais trop grande.

15
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:16,480
Ça remonte

16
00:00:16,480 --> 00:00:17,400
doucement.

17
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:18,120
Là, c'est

18
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:18,880
la cheville.

19
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:19,520
Je ne sens plus

20
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:20,960
mes orteils

21
00:00:20,960 --> 00:00:21,480
à chaque fois

22
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:22,280
que je respire.

23
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:22,800
Ça remonte

24
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:24,280
d'un cran.

25
00:00:24,280 --> 00:00:24,560
Alors

26
00:00:24,560 --> 00:00:24,920
j'essaie de

27
00:00:24,920 --> 00:00:26,680
ne plus respirer.

28
00:00:26,680 --> 00:00:27,600
Je peux pas.

29
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:28,760
Léa soulève

30
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:29,400
la couette.

31
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:30,000
Dis moi que c'est

32
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,560
rien.

33
00:00:31,560 --> 00:00:33,560
Juste dit le.

34
00:00:33,680 --> 00:00:34,800
Tu réponds pas.

35
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:35,760
Tu bouges plus.

36
00:00:35,760 --> 00:00:36,400
Je t'entends

37
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:37,800
respirer.

38
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:39,560
Non, c'est pas toi,

39
00:00:39,560 --> 00:00:40,560
C'est dessous.

40
00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:41,960
C'est lent.

41
00:00:41,960 --> 00:00:43,320
Léa !

42
00:00:43,320 --> 00:00:43,880
Ça vient de

43
00:00:43,880 --> 00:00:45,800
dire mon prénom...

44
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:46,960
Avec ta voix.
